 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Redistributed k125 (6 old models): Pro-C 3 into FabFilter Pro-C; TDR Kotelnikov into Tokyo Dawn dynamics; TDR Nova into EQ; Valhalla Supermassive into Valhalla reverbs; OTT into Compressor; LFO Tool into Delay & modulation volume shapers. Ten further kinds are new and built from the Dubspot 2026 rankings, a SampleFocus EQ roundup and Wikipedia articles on the hardware (LA-2A, 1176, Pultec, Lexicon, Echoplex, Reverb effect) and companies. Hardware-emulation archetypes group the community-named originals (LA-2A, 1176, SSL bus, Fairchild, Pultec, EMT 140/250, Lexicon, Echoplex, Space Echo, Ampex, Studer). Not on any retrieved page and therefore omitted: Xfer OTT details beyond the old-data entry, Lexicon 480L plug-in from Lexicon itself, Neve 1073 emulations, Pro Tools stock plug-ins, Voxengo and Youlean makers beyond the ranking. EQ coverage is thinner because the Dubspot EQ page was not found. Brand entries use fetched pages; countries blank where unsure. | Coordinator: Caelum Audio Flux Mini 2 and Flux Pro (old-data models moved out of Software synthesiser in 07_00) placed here as filter effects."
}